<%#
The reading desk under an intact plate (app.js, initDesk): the current pair
shown large, two numbers to type, the sum and its letter on the tablet, the
text so far. Its first state is drawn here as the script draws it, so nothing
moves when the script arrives. Guided shows a sign when it is tapped; Unaided
marks a wrong value without correcting it and earns the Lectio's ranks.
Locals: values (every sign's value, in reading order), tablet (value => letter),
pathless (a pathless plate: the way is to find; the desk asks which, and keeps a
notebook of the ways tried; the pair boxes wait empty for a way), own (a plate
with a tablet of its own: the page holds no tablet, only the values every tablet
deals out (data-values); the pairs are read for their sums, and the text line is
the notebook's, in pencil and ink: _notebook.erb). Both (the expert plate): the
way is found on sums alone, a sum on no tablet breaks it, and three pairs that
land open the notebook on that way
%>
<% pathless_desk = defined?(pathless) ? pathless : false %>
<% own_desk = defined?(own) ? own : false %>
<% expert = pathless_desk && own_desk %>
<section class="desk awaits-script" aria-labelledby="desk-title" data-desk data-desk-mode="guided"<%= ' data-desk-pathless' if pathless_desk %><%= ' data-desk-own' if own_desk %>
         data-tablet="<%= JSON.generate(tablet) %>"<% if own_desk %> data-values="<%= JSON.generate(Cistergraphia::CHARACTERS.keys.sort) %>"<% end %> data-null="<%= Cistergraphia::EVIL_MARKER %>" data-glyph-table="<%= glyph_table_json %>">
  <div class="desk-head">
    <h2 id="desk-title" class="index-heading">Read it</h2>
    <div class="segments desk-modes" role="group" aria-label="How to read">
      <button type="button" class="segment" data-desk-set-mode="guided" aria-pressed="true"><span class="segment-title">Guided</span></button>
      <button type="button" class="segment" data-desk-set-mode="unaided" aria-pressed="false"><span class="segment-title">Unaided</span></button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <% if pathless_desk %><%== erb :_ways, layout: false, locals: { at: 'desk' } %><% end %>
  <div class="desk-nav">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" data-desk-step="-1" aria-label="Previous pair">‹</button>
    <span class="desk-which" data-desk-which aria-live="polite"><%= pathless_desk ? 'Choose a way to read' : "Pair 1 of #{values.size / 2} · signs 1 and 2" %></span>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" data-desk-step="1" aria-label="Next pair">›</button>
  </div>
  <form class="desk-pair" data-desk-form>
    <div class="desk-sign" data-desk-sign="0"><%== glyph_svg(values[0], css: 'glyph desk-glyph', title: 'The first sign of the pair') unless pathless_desk %></div>
    <label class="visually-hidden" for="desk-first">What the first sign reads</label>
    <input type="number" id="desk-first" class="input desk-value" min="0" max="9999" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" placeholder="first" data-desk-value="0">
    <span class="desk-op" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
    <div class="desk-sign" data-desk-sign="1"><%== glyph_svg(values[1], css: 'glyph desk-glyph', title: 'The second sign of the pair') unless pathless_desk %></div>
    <label class="visually-hidden" for="desk-second">What the second sign reads</label>
    <input type="number" id="desk-second" class="input desk-value" min="0" max="9999" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" placeholder="second" data-desk-value="1">
    <span class="desk-op" aria-hidden="true">=</span>
    <output class="desk-letter" data-desk-letter aria-label="The letter the pair makes">?</output>
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--small" data-desk-read>Read</button>
  </form>
  <p class="desk-feedback" data-desk-feedback aria-live="polite"><%= if expert then 'Nothing says where it begins, nor what its sums read. Choose a way: its sums are the tablet’s values, or not.'
                                                                      elsif pathless_desk then 'Nothing says where the plate begins. Choose a way: the pairs form along it, and read as letters or do not.'
                                                                      elsif own_desk then 'Type what each sign reads: the page adds them. The sum is a letter only the notebook knows.'
                                                                      else 'Type what each sign reads: the page adds them and finds the letter on the tablet. Guided, a tap on a sign shows its value.'
                                                                      end %></p>
  <p class="desk-text<%= ' desk-text--notebook' if own_desk && !expert %>" data-desk-text aria-live="polite"><%= '·' * (own_desk && !expert ? Cistergraphia::Notebook.pairs(values).size : values.size / 2) %></p>
  <% if pathless_desk %>
    <p class="desk-notebook" data-desk-notebook aria-live="polite"><%= expert ? 'The ways tried, and where each broke.' : 'The notebook: what each way gave, and where it broke.' %></p>
  <% end %>
  <p class="lectio-standing desk-standing"><span data-desk-rank>Novice</span> · <span data-desk-streak>0</span> in a row · best <span data-desk-best>0</span></p>
</section>
